STATISTICS:

Damage: 1d6+1 (crushing)
Speed Factor: 6
Proficiency Type: Mace
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 11 Strength

Weight: 10"

	SAY NAME2 "Skullcrasher +3"
	SAY DESC "This mace is permanently bloodstained, a telltale trace of its many years spent bashing heads. The weapon would have been the bane of humanoids throughout its history, but those that wielded it seem to have been purposely left out of historic record.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +3
Damage: 1d6+4, +5 extra vs. humanoids
Damage type: Crushing
Speed Factor: 3
Proficiency Type: Mace
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 11 Strength

Weight: 6"



